-- comments
1:1 plain -- A newline followed by a non-space byte at column 1 ends every markup mode
2:1 plain -- (frontend.md §9.1): the unclosed `<div>` does not swallow the rest of the
3:1 plain -- file as text. Its text run ends with the newline, `after` is lexed as the
4:1 plain -- declaration it is and checks, and `<span>` and `<div>` are each
5:1 plain -- unclosed_element at their `<` (7:10, 7:5), naming `after` on column 1.
